    <text key="mobile.small.4"><![CDATA[Confirm it’s you]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.small.5"><![CDATA[Verifying and running compliance checks…]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.h4.4"><![CDATA[Sent instantly]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.small.6"><![CDATA[Aarav Mehta received the money]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.span.7"><![CDATA[Amount]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.b.4"><![CDATA[$100.00]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.span.8"><![CDATA[Status]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.b.5"><![CDATA[Delivered ✓]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.span.9"><![CDATA[Receipt]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.b.6"><![CDATA[Live]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.pbtn.2"><![CDATA[Done]]></text>
    <text key="mobile.mid.1"><![CDATA[Illustrative screens]]></text>
    <!-- tech -->
    <text key="tech.h2.1"><![CDATA[Built for <span class="grad">speed, trust and scale</span>]]></text>
    <text key="tech.sub.1"><![CDATA[The technology that makes instant settlement dependable for institutions and everyday users.]]></text>
    <text key="tech.h3.1"><![CDATA[Stablecoin &amp; CBDC native]]></text>
    <text key="tech.p.1"><![CDATA[Designed from day one for tokenised money, bridging private and sovereign digital currencies.]]></text>
    <text key="tech.h3.2"><![CDATA[Global liquidity network]]></text>
    <text key="tech.p.2"><![CDATA[Banks, dealers and fintechs plug into shared liquidity so payments always find a path.]]></text>
    <text key="tech.h3.3"><![CDATA[Partner badges &amp; incentives]]></text>
    <text key="tech.p.3"><![CDATA[Non-fungible operational badges and a multi-currency token reward system keep liquidity partners aligned.]]></text>
    <text key="tech.h3.4"><![CDATA[Compliance by design]]></text>
    <text key="tech.p.4"><![CDATA[Regulatory and policy rules are enforced in the rails, not added afterwards.]]></text>
    <text key="tech.h3.5"><![CDATA[Wallet &amp; local payment flows]]></text>
    <text key="tech.p.5"><![CDATA[Multi-asset wallets on web and mobile, with QR and UPI-style flows for everyday payments.]]></text>
    <text key="tech.h3.6"><![CDATA[AI agent interface]]></text>
    <text key="tech.p.6"><![CDATA[Command your wallet and trades in plain language through an agent that works on live account state.]]></text>
    <!-- who -->
    <text key="who.h2.1"><![CDATA[One network, <span class="grad">every participant</span>]]></text>
    <text key="who.sub.1"><![CDATA[Whether you move money, hold liquidity or build products, TessereX gives you a faster rail.]]></text>
    <text key="who.h3.1"><![CDATA[Banks &amp; fintechs]]></text>
    <text key="who.p.1"><![CDATA[Offer customers instant international transfers without building rails yourself.]]></text>
    <text key="who.h3.2"><![CDATA[Liquidity partners]]></text>
    <text key="who.p.2"><![CDATA[Earn from the flows you enable, with recognised standing on the network.]]></text>
    <text key="who.h3.3"><![CDATA[Businesses]]></text>
    <text key="who.p.3"><![CDATA[Pay suppliers and teams abroad in seconds, with predictable costs.]]></text>
    <text key="who.h3.4"><![CDATA[Individuals]]></text>
    <text key="who.p.4"><![CDATA[Send money home or across borders and see it arrive straight away.]]></text>
